msgstr "上矢印"

msgid "Voice conversation"
msgstr "音声通話"

msgid ""
"Voice conversation isn't available while you're on a phone call, because "
"the call is using the microphone. The rest of the session works normally."
msgstr "通話中は、マイクが通話に使用されているため、音声会話は利用できません。それ以外の機能は通常通り動作します。"

msgid "VoiceOver rotor actions"
msgstr "VoiceOverのローター操作"

